# ---- Secrets ----
# `<service>/enc.env` is SOPS/age-encrypted and IS tracked on purpose — it is the
# only copy of the configuration in the repo. It does not match the patterns
# below; do not add one for it. `<service>/enc.env.example` documents its
# plaintext shape and is tracked too.
#
# ./runit.sh decrypts enc.env straight into its own environment and no longer
# writes any `<service>/.env`. These patterns stay as a backstop, so a file
# created by hand — or left behind by an older checkout — still cannot be
# committed. The root .env is covered too; nothing in this project uses one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# Traefik ACME store — contains account + certificate PRIVATE KEYS
traefik/letsencrypt/
traefik/acme.json

# SearXNG runtime settings — contains server.secret_key
SearXNG/core-config/settings.yml

# ---- Local / OS noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ---- Editors ----
.vscode/
.idea/

